{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":9664,"chapterID":76,"chapterNumber":"3","sectionNumber":"28-313.3.3","title":"§ 28-313.3.3 Waiver recommendation.","sourceHTMLPath":"code-sections/general-administrative-provisions/chapters/Chapter 3.html","blocks":[{"id":"9664-html-1","kind":"html","html":"</div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-158646\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-158646\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>The mayor's office for people with disabilities, or its successor agency shall be consulted by and shall advise the commissioner concerning each application for a waiver under section <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '/codes/newyorkcity/latest/NYCadmin/0-0-0-158632', hash: '#JD_28-313.3.1' }}\">28-313.3.1</Link>. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-158647\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-158647\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(L.L. 2019/122, 6/29/2019, eff. 1/1/2020) \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-158648\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-158648\"></AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"EdNoteSm\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Editor's note:</span> For related unconsolidated provisions, see Appendix A at <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '/codes/newyorkcity/latest/NYCadmin/0-0-0-128490', hash: '#JD_L.L.2019/122' }}\">L.L. 2019/122</Link>. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div></div>\n<div><span depth=\"6\"></span><CodeOptions destID=\"rid-0-0-0-158649\" class=\"Article\"></CodeOptions><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-158649\" class=\"Article toc-destination rbox\" style=\"margin-top: .5rem\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-158649\"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name=\"JD_28-314\" id=\"JD_28-314\" title=\"28-314\"></a>Article 314: Reserved</h6></div><div class=\